# Architecture

- `src/sim/` is CPU gameplay. It must not import Phaser.
- `src/view/` only draws sim state. No combat rules in scenes.
- `src/data/` holds JSON balance. Do not hardcode item/enemy numbers in classes.
- New content is JSON. New skill *behaviors* need a sim effect case.
- HUD, pause, level-up, menus = HTML/CSS in `src/ui/`. Not Phaser text.

Pools and collision:

- Pool every gameplay object. No `new Sprite()` in the update loop.
- Projectiles and fodder enemies use AABB + spatial hash (~128px cells).
- Arcade/Matter physics: player vs world only. Never on bullets or swarms.

Two render paths:

- Player, elites, bosses = normal sprites.
- Fodder, gems, sparks = `SpriteGPULayer` / GPU particles.
- Populate GPU layers once. Hide members with `alpha`/`scale` 0. Do not `removeMembers` per frame.
